# A wall in front of the right shoulder limits the new forward camera shift.
# Actual mouse-driven game camera; aim-camera records near-plane and origin-shell wall rays.
cheat god
set time 12 0
view full
overlay off
equip ItRw_Bow_L_01
give ItRw_Arrow 100
stats str 120 dex 120 bow 100 talent 0
goto NW_CITY_MERCHANT_PATH_09
wait 500
corner left go 4
draw bow
wait 1500
cam game
ui on
press action
wait 1000
aimat ahead 1000 -1850 mouse
wait 1200
rec steep_wall
wait 600
shot steep_wall_60
aimat ahead 300 -1850 mouse
wait 1200
shot steep_wall_80
aimat ahead 100 -1850 mouse
wait 1200
shot steep_wall_89
stop
release action
aimat off
# The mouse points at the roof lip rather than at an NPC below it. Disable stepping
# to isolate looking past the close ray hit; the elevated hero reference must still lean.
disarm
goto pos 14591 2349 -14597
cheat full
ani player S_RUN
wait 500
face 247.5
aimwalk off
aim off
draw bow
wait 1500
press action
wait 1500
goto pos 14591 2349 -14597
wait 400
face 247.5
edge 247.5 2000 90 exact
aimat ahead 75 -14 mouse
aim on
wait 1800
rec crosshair_edge
wait 1000
shot crosshair_edge_drawn
stop
release action
aimat off
aimwalk on
